;
; How Pawprint files a breakpoint, in MYRA (pawprint_rules.h PR5): the file
; it is in (its place among the files opened), its line, its condition (the
; hits to pass before it stops, 0 every time) and the hits so far. Pawprint
; asks whether the numbers fit before it lists them.
^ZXBREAK(file:i2, line:i7) = condition:i9! ^ hits:i9!
